<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vessel</i> to hold liquids, e.g. wine, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.289
			</span></i>; milk, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.643
			</span></i>; <i>vat</i> for the vintage, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				613
			</span></i>; <i>pitcher</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				55
			</span></i>; <i>bucket, pail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.62
			</span></i>; <i>wine-bowl</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				953
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				960
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> for dry
			substances, <i>cradle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				32
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1337
			</span></i>; <i>casket</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				622
			</span></i>;<i>cinerary urn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				1118
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				1205
			</span></i>; <i>coffin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3573
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Assos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of parts of the body, e.g. <i>womb</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.5.11
			</span></i>, v.
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ad loc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόφιμον ἄ</span>.
				<i>stomach</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>shell</i> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάραβος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.406
			</span></i>.</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>cell</i> of a honey-comb, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.226
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Zonas</span>).</div>
